    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghosty\u2019s Big Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <strong>Ghosty</strong>, brave and curious, half cat &amp; half ghost and on an epic 2D action-adventure! Explore vibrant, hand-drawn worlds filled with exciting quests, quirky characters, and mysterious creatures. Along the way, you\u2019ll chat with NPCs, lend a helping paw, and solve tricky challenges as you uncover secrets and discover what it takes to be a true adventurer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Explore multiple worlds</strong>: From spiky forests to underground castles, each realm is packed with new surprises and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Interact with NPCs</strong>: Meet friendly faces that will guide you, give you quests, and share their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong>: Feel the natural flow of the world as objects move and react in fun and unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Ghosty become an adventurer just like her grandma? Grab your backpack, adventurer book and start your journey!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghosty\u2019s Big Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <strong>Ghosty</strong>, brave and curious, half cat &amp; half ghost and on an epic 2D action-adventure! Explore vibrant, hand-drawn worlds filled with exciting quests, quirky characters, and mysterious creatures. Along the way, you\u2019ll chat with NPCs, lend a helping paw, and solve tricky challenges as you uncover secrets and discover what it takes to be a true adventurer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Explore multiple worlds</strong>: From spiky forests to underground castles, each realm is packed with new surprises and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Interact with NPCs</strong>: Meet friendly faces that will guide you, give you quests, and share their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong>: Feel the natural flow of the world as objects move and react in fun and unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Ghosty become an adventurer just like her grandma? Grab your backpack, adventurer book and start your journey!</p>",
